      "title": "TeSS &amp;ndash; Training Portal",
      "abstract": "<ns3:p>\n                  TeSS is ELIXIR\u2019s training portal, where users can browse, discover and organise life science training resources aggregated automatically from ELIXIR nodes and 3rd-party providers: these resources include events and\u00a0 courses, as well as training materials available online at\n                  <ns3:ext-link xmlns:ns4=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" ext-link-type=\"uri\" ns4:href=\"https://tess.elixir-uk.org\">https</ns3:ext-link>\n                  <ns3:ext-link xmlns:ns4=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" ext-link-type=\"uri\" ns4:href=\"https://tess.elixir-uk.org\">://tess.elixir-</ns3:ext-link>\n                  <ns3:ext-link xmlns:ns4=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" ext-link-type=\"uri\" ns4:href=\"https://tess.elixir-uk.org\">uk.org</ns3:ext-link>\n                  .\n                </ns3:p>",
